<p><span>Q 1</span> - The Java programming language was developed by which of the following :</p>
<p><a class="false" href="javascript:void(0);"><span>A</span> - Google in 1990s </a></p>
<p><a class="false" href="javascript:void(0);"><span>B</span> - Micorsoft in 1980s</a></p>
<p><a class="true" href="javascript:void(0);"><span>C</span> - Sun Microsystems in 1995</a></p>
<p><a class="false" href="javascript:void(0);"><span>D</span> - None of the Above </a></p>
</div>
<div class="A" id="A1">
<h3>Answer : C</h3>
<h3>Explanation</h3>
<p>Java was developed by James Gosling at Sun Microsystems and it was released in May 1995 as a core component of Sun Microsystems' Java platform.</p>
